OL,6,     FLiverpool to Blackpool: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo journeys to Liverpool's
OL,8,     Fhistoric waterfront, where he
OL,9,     Fvisits the International Slavery
OL,10,     FMuseum, before heading north
OL,11,     Ftowards Blackpool.
